urther education) and egocentric behavior. Could ask for any evidence of how egocentric manifests. But we must not ask tool unless needed. We can just state recommendation.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 3, recommend Candidate A, because of quick correct decisions, 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, outweighing communication difficulty and egocentric, which can be mitigated. Also note that other candidates have more severe crew cooperation issues.\n\nVote: Candidate A.\n\nNow produce output."}
